<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Moulinex raised at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Moulinex raised at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French kitchen appliance maker Moulinex was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analyst Jill Hodges at CSFB said the downside risk on the stock was decreasing and that it was fair to strip out some of the most conservative assumptions on operating margins.</p>
<p>She set a &quot;fair value&quot; estimate of 160 francs on the stock, which was up 1.1 percent at 140 francs by 0913 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
